      "justification": "Whole-TU token gate preserves kernel C; configured compiler headers establish size_t and unsigned plain char. Existing frontend/header substitutions are consumed and hashed. The normal-domain assert dsize<count is Valid before BUG_ON on all append samples, so replaced trap is never reached. Search has no trap/calls. Strong quantified contracts are intentionally absent to make this EVA evaluation independent.",
